-### Management Acceptance Boundaries
-
-- **Baseline traps:** the review records 24 uncommitted specification files and
-  the RC7 pin, candidate/worktree generated-contract differences (including
-  observation profile p4 versus p3), and roughly half a million untracked
-  evidence members. These are observations to recheck at scoped checkpoint,
-  not a reason to inventory the whole workspace now. A source commit alone
-  does not preserve the accepted candidate. Preserve exact candidate bytes;
-  never run a naive `git add -A`. Preservation creates no clean-build claim.
-- **Context and contract truth:** GTL owns declared input and environment
-  contracts. `a_c` accesses the selected axiomatic programs; it does not apply
-  axioms or select work. Reference frames govern role, outcome, authority,
-  relevant current workspace, evidence and constraints. Source-development use
-  of RC7 is not evidence of runtime adoption. Required content is supplied or
-  actually accessible through the declared capability; a closed-prompt actor
-  cannot resolve an omitted body from a locator alone. Policy/context identities
-  and included/omitted decisions remain replayable. Requirements/Design field
-  domains, reference domains, coverage rules and usable rejection details appear
-  in the actor's contract and receive naive-variation tests.
-- **Ingress scope:** 03's handoff explicitly treats install/bind operation
-  identity and the eleven caller-supplied Public-start authority values. It
-  either establishes the lawful derivation/validation owner or names the
-  exclusion, remaining obligation and dependent claim held. Context binding
-  alone cannot claim complete ingress authority qualification.
-- **One cause owner:** ABG admitted events own causal truth. Existing stage,
-  HoG and Public projections conserve that cause, blocked status and evidence;
-  they do not replace it with a generic failure or infer model progress from
-  silence. F_P remains a black box with visible inputs, effects and reports.
-- **Cost evidence:** 02 separates actor-process time, native computation and
-  other waiting; time outside actors is not automatically native CPU. Measure
-  history-dependent cost on equivalent operations and fix the observed owner
-  path, without a universal constant-cost claim. Bind the workload and numeric
-  limits at activation; diagnosis-only work cannot close a repair milestone.
-  Set any repair target before implementation, never from achieved results.
-  The one-hour execution envelope remains binding wherever selected. It is
-  not a runtime performance SLA; only an explicit scoped grant changes that
-  activation's envelope. The existing larger live grants apply only to their
-  recorded subjects and effects.
-- **D2 continuity:** the [accepted D2 traversal design](../../../build_tenants/abiogenesis/typescript/design/T287_D2_REQUIREMENT_LIFECYCLE_DESIGN.md#traversal-and-minimal-realization)
-  permits a declared live re-entry or separately admitted, causally linked
-  successor Run. The host may submit an authorized request; native selection
-  chooses the work. No terminal Run revival, mandatory same-Run resume or
-  host-scripted sequence of stages is introduced.
-- **Witness continuity:** the [selected keyed-accounting witness](../../../../odd_glc/.ai-workspace/comments/codex/20260913_ABG5_D1_WITNESS_01/witness.md)
-  remains the bounded F17 application obligation under odd_glc T-043. The
-  two-job discriminator neither substitutes its oracle nor closes it. Full
-  original Data Mapper remains an independently owned upper-bound evaluation.
-  Existing release qualification and actual human acceptance remain required.
-- **Bounded spend and continuation:** every paid activation declares finite
-  actor/attempt allowances, observation limits and a stop/return condition
-  before launch. No automatic retry or replenishment follows from failure.
-  This does not reinstate removed token-cost requirements or authorize billing
-  infrastructure. A hard monetary Product cap needs a separate owner decision.
-  Existing prospectively enlarged live envelopes remain exact scoped grants;
-  elapsed time prompts root-cause assessment, while repeated work without new
-  evidence or a widening rabbit hole stops continuation.
-- **Preserved boundaries:** one direct HoG traversal engine and one ABG event
-  truth remain. Event-store/database/locking rewrites, resilience expansion and
-  additional W2 arms outside the bounded design are unselected. Whole-run
-  executive supervision, automatic upstream A.0 re-entry and native human
-  response/resume remain 5.1.
